# A read under a written name is scanned when its list is first asked for. `tag` is written in front of the comparison and first asked for where `v` is not `true`; behind the rejoin it is what
# `true.tag` gave as well. Scanned off `v` without `true` it was proven a number, and eight programs of this form stopped. It reads its object as the object lay where the read is written.
# f1 = inFront, f2 = behind
